---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Impact Frameworks, Learning & Dissemination"
  description="Turning evaluation findings into results frameworks, learning processes and reporting that partners can act on."
>
  <section class="section service-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/#what-we-do">&larr; What We Do</a></p>
      <h1>Impact Frameworks, Learning &amp; Dissemination</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        An evaluation that sits unread in a drawer has no impact of its own.
        We design results frameworks and learning processes that turn
        findings into decisions.
      </p>

      <div class="body-grid">
        <div>
          <h2>What this covers</h2>
          <p>
            Impact and results frameworks that connect a programme&rsquo;s
            activities to its intended outcomes, written so funders,
            implementing partners and community stakeholders can all read
            the same document and agree on what success looks like.
          </p>
          <p>
            We facilitate learning sessions with programme teams to walk
            through evaluation findings, and we prepare dissemination formats
            matched to each audience: funder reports, briefs, or
            plain-language summaries for community partners.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>How we work</h2>
          <p>
            We write for the reader who has to act on the findings. That
            usually means shorter, clearer documents than a standard
            evaluation report, paired with a facilitated conversation to walk
            the team through what the findings mean.
          </p>
          <p>
            Programmes often span several partners: a funder, an
            implementing organisation and a research or evaluation partner.
            We help keep everyone working from a shared understanding of
            what the evidence shows.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="pill-btn" href="/contact">Talk to us about your reporting</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-page .eyebrow a {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .body-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--gap);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .cta-row {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(40, 40, 40, 0.1);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .body-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
